  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "故事寫作",
    "sub_ename": "STORY WRITING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程藉由中外經典故事閱讀，帶領學生賞析的故事形式與內容，並藉由閱讀、觀察、紀錄、發想與實作，按部就班掌握敘事的技藝。此外，透過觀摩與呈現，建立鑑賞及評論能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Through the reading of Chinese and foreign classic stories, this course leads students to appreciate the form and content of the story, and through reading, observation, recording, thinking and practice, master the narrative skills step by step. In addition, through observation and presentation, build appreciation and criticism skills.",
